@startuml
title Order lifecycle - state
[*] --> Pending : order created
Pending --> Paid : payment approved
Pending --> Cancelled : payment declined / cancelled
Paid --> Fulfilled : shipped and delivered
Paid --> Refunded : refund completed
Fulfilled --> Refunded : return refunded
Cancelled --> [*]
Fulfilled --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]
@enduml
